Intel CVS media path support, backported from Intel PR #59:
https://github.com/intel/ipu7-camera-hal/pull/59
Merged as 11d8aff0d1ddc16aef56c8e6518e08e2f936a95b.

Apply the same OV08X40 bridge topology to Panther Lake (ipu75xa), whose
Linux 7.2 CVS driver exposes sensor -> Intel CVS -> CSI2. Keep Intel's
existing platform-specific image tuning and processing graph unchanged.
The sensor already appears in ipu75xa/libcamhal_configs.json.

